    "long_instructions": "\r\n### Scenario 3\r\n\r\nInstead of silently failing, give users a way to try again without refreshing the page.\r\n\r\n**Do This:**\r\n\r\n1. Find the catch block in `script.js`.\r\n2. Call `showErrorScreen()` to replace the event card with a 404-style message.\r\n3. Add an event listener to `retryButton` that calls `getEvent()` again when clicked.",
    "start_sources": {
      "folders": {
      },
      "files": {
        "1": {
          "id": "1",
          "name": "style.css",
          "contents": ":root {\n  --primary: #3B2FC9;\n  --primary-hover: #2a20a0;\n  --bg: #f0f2f8;\n  --card-bg: #ffffff;\n  --text-main: #1a1f36;\n  --text-muted: #5c6b8a;\n  --border: #dde1ee;\n  --nav-bg: #1a1f36;\n}\n\n* {\n  box-sizing: border-box;\n  margin: 0;\n  padding: 0;\n}\n\nbody {\n  font-family: 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\n  background-color: var(--bg);\n  color: var(--text-main);\n}\n\n/* ── HEADER ── */\nheader {\n  background-color: var(--nav-bg);\n  padding: 1rem 2rem;\n  display: flex;\n  justify-content: space-between;\n  align-items: center;\n}\n\n.logo {\n  font-weight: 700;\n  font-size: 1.1rem;\n  color: #ffffff;\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 8px;\n}\n\n.logo::before {\n  content: \"\";\n  display: inline-block;\n  width: 22px;\n  height: 22px;\n  background: var(--primary);\n  border-radius: 6px;\n}\n\nnav a {\n  color: #c5cde8;\n  text-decoration: none;\n  margin-left: 24px;\n  font-size: 0.9rem;\n  font-weight: 500;\n  transition: color 0.15s;\n}\n\nnav a:hover {\n  color: #ffffff;\n}\n\n/* ── MAIN ── */\nmain {\n  padding: 2rem;\n  max-width: 800px;\n  margin: 0 auto;\n}\n\nh1 {\n  color: var(--text-main);\n  text-align: center;\n  margin-bottom: 2rem;\n  font-size: 1.5rem;\n}\n\n/* ── EVENT CARD ── */\n.event-card {\n  background-color: var(--card-bg);\n  border-radius: 12px;\n  overflow: hidden;\n  box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);\n  border: 1px solid var(--border);\n  max-width: 600px;\n  margin: 0 auto;\n}\n\n.image-container {\n  width: 100%;\n  height: 280px;\n  background-color: #d0d5e8;\n  overflow: hidden;\n}\n\n.image-container img {\n  width: 100%;\n  height: 100%;\n  object-fit: cover;\n}\n\n.content-container {\n  padding: 1.5rem 2rem;\n  text-align: center;\n}\n\n.content-container h2 {\n  margin: 0 0 8px 0;\n  font-size: 1.2rem;\n  color: var(--text-main);\n}\n\n.content-container p {\n  color: var(--text-muted);\n  font-size: 0.9rem;\n}\n\n/* ── OVERLAY ── */\n.overlay {\n  position: fixed;\n  inset: 0;\n  background: rgba(10, 14, 40, 0.55);\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: center;\n  z-index: 100;\n}\n\n.overlay.hidden {\n  display: none;\n}\n\n/* ── MODAL ── */\n.modal {\n  background: #ffffff;\n  border-radius: 16px;\n  padding: 2rem;\n  max-width: 460px;\n  width: 90%;\n  box-shadow: 0 24px 64px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.22);\n  position: relative;\n}\n\n.modal-close {\n  position: absolute;\n  top: 14px;\n  right: 16px;\n  background: none;\n  border: none;\n  font-size: 1.3rem;\n  color: #9aa0b8;\n  cursor: pointer;\n  line-height: 1;\n  padding: 4px;\n}\n\n.modal-close:hover {\n  color: var(--text-main);\n}\n\n.modal-header {\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 14px;\n  margin-bottom: 1rem;\n}\n\n.modal-icon {\n  flex-shrink: 0;\n  width: 48px;\n  height: 48px;\n  background: #e63946;\n  color: white;\n  font-size: 1.5rem;\n  font-weight: 900;\n  border-radius: 50%;\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: center;\n}\n\n.modal-title {\n  font-size: 1.25rem;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  color: var(--text-main);\n}\n\n.modal-message {\n  font-family: monospace;\n  font-size: 0.85rem;\n  color: var(--text-muted);\n  line-height: 1.7;\n  margin-bottom: 1.5rem;\n  padding: 0 0 0 62px;\n}\n\n.modal-footer {\n  display: flex;\n  justify-content: flex-end;\n}\n\n#closeModal {\n  background-color: var(--primary);\n  color: white;\n  border: none;\n  padding: 11px 36px;\n  border-radius: 50px;\n  cursor: pointer;\n  font-size: 0.95rem;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  transition: background 0.2s;\n}\n\n#closeModal:hover {\n  background-color: var(--primary-hover);\n}\n\n/* ── ERROR SCREEN ── */\n.hidden {\n  display: none;\n}\n\n.error-screen {\n  max-width: 600px;\n  margin: 0 auto;\n  text-align: center;\n  padding: 4rem 2rem;\n}\n\n.error-icon svg {\n  width: 64px;\n  height: 64px;\n  margin-bottom: 1.5rem;\n  opacity: 0.5;\n}\n\n.error-code {\n  font-size: 5rem;\n  font-weight: 900;\n  color: #ffffff;\n  line-height: 1;\n  margin-bottom: 0.5rem;\n}\n\n.error-title {\n  font-size: 1.3rem;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  color: #ffffff;\n  margin-bottom: 0.75rem;\n}\n\n.error-body {\n  font-size: 0.95rem;\n  color: var(--text-muted);\n  line-height: 1.5;\n  margin-bottom: 2rem;\n}\n\n#retryButton {\n  background-color: transparent;\n  color: var(--primary);\n  border: 2px solid var(--primary);\n  padding: 12px 32px;\n  border-radius: 50px;\n  cursor: pointer;\n  font-size: 1rem;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  transition: background 0.2s, color 0.2s;\n}\n\n#retryButton:hover {\n  background-color: var(--primary);\n  color: #ffffff;\n}\n",
          "folderId": "0",
          "active": false
        },
        "2": {
          "id": "2",
          "name": "index.html",
          "contents": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\" />\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\" />\n  <title>Campus Events</title>\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"style.css\" />\n</head>\n<body>\n\n  <header>\n    <div class=\"logo\">Campus Events</div>\n    <nav>\n      <a href=\"#\">Concerts</a>\n      <a href=\"#\">Sports</a>\n    </nav>\n  </header>\n\n  <main>\n    <h1>Featured Event</h1>\n\n    <!-- Event Card -->\n    <div id=\"app\" class=\"event-card\">\n      <div class=\"image-container\">\n        <img id=\"eventImage\" src=\"https://placehold.co/600x300/d0d5e8/9aa0b8?text=Loading...\" alt=\"Event image\" />\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"content-container\">\n        <h2 id=\"eventTitle\"></h2>\n        <p id=\"eventDate\"></p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- 404 Error Screen (hidden by default) -->\n    <div id=\"errorScreen\" class=\"error-screen hidden\">\n      <div class=\"error-icon\">\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 48 48\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n          <rect x=\"10\" y=\"4\" width=\"28\" height=\"40\" rx=\"4\" stroke=\"#555\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/>\n          <path d=\"M20 22 Q24 27 28 22\" stroke=\"#555\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/>\n          <circle cx=\"20\" cy=\"17\" r=\"1.5\" fill=\"#555\"/>\n          <circle cx=\"28\" cy=\"17\" r=\"1.5\" fill=\"#555\"/>\n        </svg>\n      </div>\n      <h2 class=\"error-code\">404</h2>\n      <p class=\"error-title\">Page not found</p>\n      <p class=\"error-body\">The page you're looking for doesn't exist or has been moved.</p>\n      <button id=\"retryButton\">Try again</button>\n    </div>\n  </main>\n\n  <script src=\"helpers.js\"></script>\n  <script src=\"script.js\"></script>\n</body>\n</html>\n",
          "folderId": "0",
          "active": false
        },
        "3": {
          "id": "3",
          "name": "helpers.js",
          "contents": "const app         = document.getElementById(\"app\");\nconst errorScreen = document.getElementById(\"errorScreen\");\n\n// Hides the event card and shows the 404 error screen.\nconst showErrorScreen = () => {\n  app.classList.add(\"hidden\");\n  errorScreen.classList.remove(\"hidden\");\n};\n\n// Hides the error screen and shows the event card again.\nconst showEventCard = () => {\n  errorScreen.classList.add(\"hidden\");\n  app.classList.remove(\"hidden\");\n};\n",
          "folderId": "0",
          "active": false
        },
        "4": {
          "id": "4",
          "name": "script.js",
          "contents": "const eventImage  = document.getElementById(\"eventImage\");\nconst eventTitle  = document.getElementById(\"eventTitle\");\nconst eventDate   = document.getElementById(\"eventDate\");\nconst retryButton = document.getElementById(\"retryButton\");\n\nconst BROKEN_API_URL = \"https://broken-api-example.com/featured-event\";\n\nconst getEvent = async () => {\n  try {\n    const response = await fetch(BROKEN_API_URL);\n    const data = await response.json();\n\n    eventTitle.textContent = data.name;\n    eventDate.textContent  = data.venue + \" · \" + data.date;\n    eventImage.src         = data.imageUrl;\n\n  } catch (error) {\n    // TODO 1: Call showErrorScreen() to show the 404 error state\n    // TODO 2: Add an event listener to retryButton that calls getEvent()\n\n  }\n};\n\ngetEvent();\n",
          "folderId": "0",
          "active": true
        }
      },
      "openFiles": [
        "4"
      ]
    },
